      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The split between client and server in Next.js makes it tempting to duplicate small constants. The cost of doing that here is silent drift: the form might accept a file the server rejects, or vice versa. One module imported on both sides keeps the gate honest."
